
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0d0b" />
  <meta name="description" content="Richard Fehr — Software Engineer and digital solutions developer in Kenya. Explore live projects, web applications, and innovative technology solutions." />
  <title>Richard Fehr | RF Technologies — Software Engineer</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #090c0a;
      --surface: #101512;
      --surface-2: #151c17;
      --green: #b5ff69;
      --green-dark: #7bc943;
      --white: #f4f7f3;
      --muted: #9ba79d;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,.09);
      --radius: 20px;
      --max-width: 1160px;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      scroll-padding-top: 90px;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 8%, rgba(111,192,70,.09), transparent 35%),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--white);
      font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    body, button, a {
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    button {
      font: inherit;
    }

    img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(var(--max-width), calc(100% - 44px));
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .accent { color: var(--green); }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: .76rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow::before {
      content: "";
      width: 24px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--green);
    }

    .section {
      padding: 100px 0;
    }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin-bottom: 42px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      margin: 12px 0;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.3rem);
      line-height: 1.13;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 590px;
    }

    /* NAVIGATION */

    .header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      background: rgba(9,12,10,.88);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .nav {
      min-height: 76px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      letter-spacing: -.035em;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      background: var(--green);
      color: #10150d;
      border-radius: 13px;
      font-weight: 950;
      font-size: .95rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(181,255,105,.12);
    }

    .brand small {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .66rem;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: #c2cbc3;
      font-size: .88rem;
      transition: color .2s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover,
    .nav-links a.active {
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .nav-links .nav-cta {
      color: #10150d;
      background: var(--green);
      padding: 10px 17px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .nav-cta:hover,
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #ceffa0;
      color: #10150d;
    }

    .menu-toggle {
      display: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--white);
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    /* HERO */

    .hero {
      min-height: 660px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 55px;
      padding-top: 85px;
      padding-bottom: 90px;
    }

    .availability {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      padding: 7px 13px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
      border-radius: 100px;
      color: #c9d3ca;
      font-size: .78rem;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .status-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: var(--green);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--green);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 6.8vw, 5.8rem);
      line-height: .99;
      letter-spacing: -.075em;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .hero h1 .outline {
      color: transparent;
      -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #b5ff69;
    }

    .hero-description {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 570px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 13px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: .9rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      transition: transform .2s, background .2s, border-color .2s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      color: #10150d;
      background: var(--green);
      border-color: var(--green);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      border-color: var(--green);
    }

    .hero-meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 25px;
      margin-top: 38px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .82rem;
    }

    .hero-meta strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: .98rem;
    }

    /* CODE PANEL */

    .code-window {
      position: relative;
      padding: 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(181,255,105,.19);
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #151d17, #0c100d);
      box-shadow: 0 25px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .code-window::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
      right: -90px;
      bottom: -90px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--green);
      filter: blur(95px);
      opacity: .12;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .window-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      padding-bottom: 18px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .window-dot {
      width: 9px;
      height: 9px;
      background: #59645b;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .window-dot:first-child { background: #ff817a; }
    .window-dot:nth-child(2) { background: #f3c96b; }
    .window-dot:nth-child(3) { background: #91dc77; }

    .window-title {
      margin-left: auto;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .72rem;
    }

    .code {
      padding: 25px 0 12px;
      font: .86rem/2 "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .code .line-number {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 27px;
      color: #59645b;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .code .purple { color: #c6a0ff; }
    .code .yellow { color: #f3d38a; }
    .code .cyan { color: #83dce8; }
    .code .green { color: var(--green); }
    .code .muted { color: #829087; }

    .code-badge {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 13px 15px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: .8rem;
    }

    .code-badge strong { color: var(--green); }

    /* TECH STRIP */

    .tech-strip {
      border-block: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.015);
    }

    .tech-strip-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px 28px;
      padding: 25px 0;
      color: #a7b2a8;
      font-size: .84rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .tech-strip span::before {
      content: "✳";
      color: var(--green);
      margin-right: 9px;
    }

    /* SERVICES */

    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .service-card {
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      transition: border-color .25s, transform .25s;
    }

    .service-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(181,255,105,.4);
      transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .service-icon {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(181,255,105,.09);
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      margin-bottom: 23px;
    }

    .service-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }

    .service-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .9rem;
    }

    /* PROJECTS */

    .projects {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,.018), transparent);
    }

    .project-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .project-card {
      min-width: 0;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform .25s, border-color .25s;
    }

    .project-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      border-color: rgba(181,255,105,.35);
    }

    .project-visual {
      min-height: 235px;
      padding: 23px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 110%, rgba(181,255,105,.18), transparent 65%),
        #151c17;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .project-visual.purple-bg {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 110%, rgba(168,133,255,.18), transparent 65%),
        #17131f;
    }

    .project-visual.orange-bg {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 110%, rgba(255,173,95,.16), transparent 65%),
        #1c1712;
    }

    .mock-browser {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 390px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
      background: rgba(9,12,10,.93);
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
      overflow: hidden;
      transform: rotate(-2deg);
      transition: transform .3s;
    }

    .project-card:hover .mock-browser {
      transform: rotate(0);
    }

    .mock-top {
      display: flex;
      gap: 5px;
      padding: 9px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .mock-top i {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      background: #677269;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .mock-content { padding: 18px; }

    .mock-logo {
      color: var(--green);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -.04em;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .mock-title {
      margin: 18px 0 7px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      line-height: 1.25;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .mock-copy {
      color: #9ba79d;
      font-size: .68rem;
    }

    .mock-bars {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .mock-bars span {
      display: block;
      height: 8px;
      width: 30%;
      border-radius: 5px;
      background: #2e3b31;
    }

    .mock-bars span:first-child {
      background: var(--green);
      width: 42%;
    }

    .project-content { padding: 24px; }

    .project-topline {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .project-category {
      color: var(--green);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      font-size: .68rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .project-status {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      color: #c6d0c7;
      font-size: .69rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .project-status .status-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
    }

    .project-content h3 {
      margin: 0 0 9px;
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      letter-spacing: -.04em;
    }

    .project-content p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .9rem;
      margin: 0 0 19px;
    }

    .tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 7px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .tags span {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      font-size: .72rem;
      color: #c5cec6;
    }

    .project-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: .86rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .project-link:hover { color: white; }

    /* ABOUT */

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 65px;
    }

    .about-panel {
      padding: 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #172019, #0d110e);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .about-initials {
      width: 100px;
      height: 100px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 25px;
      background: var(--green);
      color: #0b1009;
      font-size: 2.1rem;
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: -.08em;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .about-panel h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .about-panel p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .9rem;
    }

    .about-copy h2 {
      margin: 12px 0 18px;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -.06em;
    }

    .about-copy p { color: var(--muted); }

    .skills {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .skills span {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-size: .8rem;
      color: #d2dbd3;
    }

    /* CONTACT */

    .contact-box {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 30px;
      padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 55px);
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 0%, rgba(181,255,105,.14), transparent 50%),
        var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid rgba(181,255,105,.2);
      border-radius: 25px;
    }

    .contact-box h2 {
      margin: 12px 0;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.3rem);
      letter-spacing: -.06em;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .contact-box p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 560px;
    }

    .contact-details {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px 25px;
      margin-top: 23px;
      font-size: .85rem;
      color: #d1dbd2;
    }

    .contact-details a:hover { color: var(--green); }

    .footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 27px 0;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 15px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .8rem;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--green); }

    /* MOTION */

    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(22px);
      transition: opacity .65s ease, transform .65s ease;
    }

    .reveal.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    :focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--green);
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        animation-duration: .01ms !important;
        transition-duration: .01ms !important;
      }

      .reveal {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: none;
      }
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 42px;
        min-height: auto;
      }

      .hero-copy { max-width: 700px; }

      .code-window {
        max-width: 600px;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .services-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }

      .about-grid { gap: 30px; }

      .contact-box { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

      .contact-box .btn { justify-self: start; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .container { width: calc(100% - 32px); }

      .section { padding: 70px 0; }

      .nav { min-height: 68px; }

      .menu-toggle {
        display: inline-grid;
        place-items: center;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: none;
        position: absolute;
        top: 68px;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        padding: 20px 22px 24px;
        background: #0c100d;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: stretch;
        gap: 5px;
      }

      .nav-links.open { display: flex; }

      .nav-links a {
        display: block;
        padding: 11px 8px;
      }

      .nav-links .nav-cta { text-align: center; margin-top: 8px; }

      .hero { padding-top: 65px; padding-bottom: 65px; gap: 35px; }

      .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 13vw, 4.4rem); }

      .hero-description { font-size: .96rem; }

      .hero-meta { gap: 20px; }

      .tech-strip-inner { justify-content: flex-start; gap: 13px 22px; }

      .services-grid,
      .project-grid,
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

      .project-visual { min-height: 210px; }

      .about-panel { padding: 24px; }

      .contact-box { padding: 27px 22px; }

      .footer-inner {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="header">
    <div class="container nav">
      <a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="RF Technologies home">
        <span class="brand-mark">RF</span>
        <span>
          RF Technologies
          <small>Engineering digital growth</small>
        </span>
      </a>

      <button
        class="menu-toggle"
        id="menuToggle"
        aria-label="Open navigation"
        aria-expanded="false"
        aria-controls="navLinks"
      >☰</button>

      <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Let's Talk ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="container hero" id="home">
      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <div class="availability">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          Software Engineering · Kenya
        </div>

        <div class="eyebrow">Hello, I'm Richard Fehr</div>

        <h1>
          Building the<br />
          <span class="accent">digital</span><br />
          <span class="outline">future.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-description">
          I design and develop modern digital experiences, business
          applications and technology solutions that help people,
          businesses and communities grow.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#projects">
            Explore my work <span>↗</span>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#contact">
            Start a project
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-meta">
          <div>
            <strong>Web Development</strong>
            <span>Modern digital products</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Business Technology</strong>
            <span>Practical solutions</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="code-window reveal" aria-label="Decorative code illustration">
        <div class="window-top">
          <span class="window-dot"></span>
          <span class="window-dot"></span>
          <span class="window-dot"></span>
          <span class="window-title">digital-solution.js</span>
        </div>

        <div class="code">
          <div><span class="line-number">01</span><span class="purple">const</span> <span class="cyan">developer</span> = {</div>
          <div><span class="line-number">02</span>&nbsp; <span class="yellow">name</span>: <span class="green">"Richard Fehr"</span>,</div>
